  "body": "Discover this rare opportunity to secure an affordable gem in sought-after Kohimarama. This charming 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom home sits on 373m² of fee simple freehold land and offers an excellent entry into the highly desirable Bays lifestyle. Whether you’re a first home buyer or looking to downsize, this is an opportunity not to be missed!\r\n\r\nImagine waking up and strolling to Kohi Beach for your morning swim, grabbing coffee at your favorite Melanesia Road café, or enjoying the open green spaces of Madill’s Farm – all just moments from your doorstep! Commuting is a breeze with a bus stop right outside, and you’re only a 15-minute drive to the CBD.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Two large lounges open out to sun-soaked decks and balconies – perfect for relaxing or entertaining friends and family. Downstairs a versatile studio apartment with its own kitchenette, laundry, sitting/dining area, and private courtyard. With a separate entrance, it’s ideal for extended family, guests, or even a work-from-home setup.\r\n\r\nA double garage workshop for your hobbies and all the extras, plus a covered carport for two more vehicles. Plenty of room for the whole family – and their toys! \r\n\r\nIn-zone for Kohimarama School, St Ignatius Primary, and Glendowie College – giving your family access to some of Auckland’s most sought-after education. \r\n\r\nWhether you’re starting out, sizing down, or just want that Bays lifestyle, this property is the perfect match. Safe, private, and ready to move in – this is a must-see! Contact us today to arrange your viewing and step into the next exciting phase of your life. First in, first served!",
